flowchart TB
  JDBC[JDBC Connection Pooling jOOQ]

  JDBC --> DRIVER[JDBC Drivers]
  DRIVER --> T4[Type 4 Pure Java]
  DRIVER --> ODBC[Type 1 JDBC-ODBC]

  JDBC --> CONN[Connection Management]
  CONN --> DM[DriverManager]
  CONN --> DS[DataSource]
  DS --> CP[Connection Pooling]
  CP --> HIKARI[HikariCP]
  HIKARI --> PS[Pool Size]
  HIKARI --> TIMEOUT[Connection Timeout]
  HIKARI --> IDLE[Idle Timeout]
  HIKARI --> LEAK[Leak Detection]

  JDBC --> API[JDBC API]
  API --> STMT[Statement]
  API --> PSTMT[PreparedStatement]
  API --> CSTMT[CallableStatement]
  API --> RS[ResultSet]
  RS --> UPD[Updatable ResultSet]
  RS --> SCROLL[Scrollable ResultSet]
  API --> BATCH[Batch Updates]
  API --> MTX[Transaction Management]

  JDBC --> JDBCT[Spring JdbcTemplate]
  JDBCT --> Q[Query]
  JDBCT --> U[Update]
  JDBCT --> B[Bulk Operations]
  JDBCT --> NPJT[NamedParameterJdbcTemplate]

  JDBC --> JOOQ[jOOQ DSL]
  JOOQ --> CG[Code Generation]
  CG --> TAB[Table Classes]
  CG --> REC[Record Classes]
  CG --> POJO[POJO Classes]
  JOOQ --> DSL[Fluent Query DSL]
  DSL --> SELECT[Select]
  DSL --> WHERE[Where Conditions]
  DSL --> JOIN[Joins]
  DSL --> UNION[Unions]
  JOOQ --> MTENANT[Multi-Tenancy]
